---
title: "Team Member Assignment (stem-system types.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_team: receive team_id, member_id
    q_validate_team --> q_check_team_exists: validate team_id is string
    q_check_team_exists --> q_check_member_exists: team exists in Team table
    q_check_member_exists --> q_create_relation: member exists in Member table
    q_check_member_exists --> q_error_member: member not found
    q_check_team_exists --> q_error_team: team not found
    q_create_relation --> q_final: create MemberTeamRelation(member_id, team_id)
    q_final --> [*]: return MemberTeamRelation
    q_error_member --> [*]: revert error
    q_error_team --> [*]: revert error

    note right of q_create_relation
        INV-001: member_id must reference valid Member.supabase_auth_user_id
        INV-002: team_id must reference valid Team.id
        INV-003: (member_id, team_id) pair must be unique
    end note
